              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "obiettare is a learned borrowing from Latin obiectāre \"to throw against, to set before, to reproach\" (Lewis & Short), formed on obicere, built from ob \"against\" and iacere \"to throw\"."
            }
          ]
        },
