              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "contraddire — \"to contradict\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Non mi piace quando mi contraddici davanti a tutti. I do not like it when you contradict me in front of everyone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Conjugated like dire: contraddico, contraddici, contraddice. Contraddirsi is to contradict yourself."
            }
          ]
        },
